{"speciesId":715,"names":{"fr":"Bruyverne","es":"Noivern","en":"Noivern","ja":"オンバーン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Les nuits sans lune, il quadrille le ciel à la recherche d’une proie. Dans l’obscurité, aucun Pokémon ne peut rivaliser avec lui."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Surca el cielo nocturno cuando ni siquiera la luna brilla y ataca a presas incautas. Es imbatible en combates que tienen lugar a oscuras."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They fly around on moonless nights and attack careless prey. Nothing can beat them in a battle in the dark."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"月明かりすら ない 闇夜を 飛び 油断している 獲物を 襲う。 暗闇の 戦いでは 無敵だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il peut littéralement pulvériser de gros rochers grâce aux ultrasons émis par ses oreilles. Il surgit des ténèbres pour attaquer par surprise."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Las ondas ultrasónicas que emite por las orejas pueden hacer añicos incluso rocas enormes. Aprovecha la oscuridad para desplegar su ataque."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The ultrasonic waves it emits from its ears can reduce a large boulder to pebbles. It swoops out of the dark to attack."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"耳から 発する 超音波で 巨大な 岩も 粉砕する。 暗闇に 紛れて 襲いかかる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Les nuits sans lune, il quadrille le ciel à la recherche d’une proie. Dans l’obscurité, aucun Pokémon ne peut rivaliser avec lui."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Surca el cielo nocturno cuando ni siquiera la luna brilla y ataca a presas incautas. Es imbatible en combates que tienen lugar a oscuras."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"They fly around on moonless nights and attack careless prey. Nothing can beat them in a battle in the dark."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"月明かりすら ない 闇夜を 飛び 油断している 獲物を 襲う。 暗闇の 戦いでは 無敵だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il peut littéralement pulvériser de gros rochers grâce aux ultrasons émis par ses oreilles. Il surgit des ténèbres pour attaquer par surprise."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Las ondas ultrasónicas que emite por las orejas pueden hacer añicos incluso rocas enormes. Aprovecha la oscuridad para desplegar su ataque."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"The ultrasonic waves it emits from its ears can reduce a large boulder to pebbles. It swoops out of the dark to attack."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"耳から 発する 超音波で 巨大な 岩も 粉砕する。 暗闇に 紛れて 襲いかかる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"D’ordinaire violent, il vous mange littéralement dans la main si vous lui donnez des fruits mûrs, son mets favori."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Es de carácter violento, pero si se le da su alimento favorito, una fruta madura, su actitud cambia totalmente y se muestra muy dócil."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Although it has a violent disposition, if you give it a nice ripe fruit that it loves, Noivern will suddenly become tame."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"乱暴な 性質だが 好物の 熟した 果物を あげると 手のひらを 返したように 懐く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Ce Pokémon sanguinaire attaque tout ce qui entre dans son champ de vision avec ses ultrasons capables de pulvériser des rochers."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"De temperamento violento, ataca a todo el que se cruce en su camino con unas ondas ultrasónicas capaces de partir rocas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"This hot-blooded Pokémon attacks anything it sees with ultrasonic waves that can crush boulders."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"岩も 砕く 超音波で 目に 入る もの すべてに 攻撃を 仕掛ける 血の気の多い ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il n’hésite pas à anéantir ses pauvres adversaires qui se retrouvent sans défense dans les ténèbres. Il est d’une nature cruelle et impulsive."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Posee un carácter violento y cruel, por lo que no muestra reparos en aprovechar la oscuridad para atacar a enemigos indefensos."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Aggressive and cruel, this Pokémon will ruthlessly torment enemies that are helpless in the dark."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"暗闇で なにも できない 敵を 念入りに 痛めつける。 血の気が 多く 残忍な 性質。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il plane dans les ténèbres, blessant ses ennemis à coups d’ultrasons pouvant briser des rochers avant de les achever de ses crocs acérés."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Vuela en la oscuridad atormentando al enemigo con ondas ultrasónicas capaces de partir rocas antes de rematarlo con sus afilados colmillos."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Flying through the darkness, it weakens enemies with ultrasonic waves that could crush stone. Its fangs finish the fight."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"暗闇を 飛びながら 岩をも 砕く 超音波で 痛めつけ 鋭い キバで とどめを 刺す。"}],"varieties":[{"id":715,"moves":[{"name":"razor-wind","learns":[[15,"level-up",31],[16,"level-up",31],[17,"level-up",31],[18,"level-up",31]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"gust","learns":[[15,"level-up",11],[16,"level-up",11],[17,"level-up",11],[18,"level-up",11],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"wing-attack","learns":[[15,"level-up",16],[16,"level-up",16],[17,"level-up",16],[18,"level-up",16],[20,"level-up",16],[25,"level-up",16]]},{"name":"whirlwind","learns":[[15,"level-up",40],[16,"level-up",40],[17,"level-up",40],[18,"level-up",40],[20,"level-up",28],[25,"level-up",28],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"fly","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"